---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Usage: help [-h] [-help] [-long_help] [-cmd <command name>] [-examples] [-pkg <package name>] [-quartus] [-tcl] [-timequestinfo] [-timinganalyzerinfo] [-version <version number>] [<package or command name>]

        -h: Quick usage
        -help: Short help
        -long_help: Long help with examples and possible return values

        -cmd <command name>: Option to display long help for a Quartus Prime Tcl command
        -examples: Option to display examples of Quartus Prime Tcl usage
        -pkg <package name>: Option to display help for an available Quartus Prime Tcl package
        -quartus: Option to display help on the predefined global "quartus" Tcl array
        -tcl: Option to display overview on Quartus Prime Tcl usage
        -timequestinfo: Deprecated alias of the "timinganalyzerinfo" option
        -timinganalyzerinfo: Option to display help on the predefined global "TimingAnalyzerInfo" Tcl array
        -version <version number>: Option to specify the package version for the specified Quartus Prime Tcl package or command
        <package or command name>: Name of an available Quartus Prime Tcl package or command. This is functionally equivalent to the -pkg and -cmd options.

------------
Description:
------------


For convenience, you can omit the "::quartus::" package prefix when
you query for help on a package. For example, you can type either of
the following to view help for the ::quartus::project package:
     help ::quartus::project
     help project

--------------
Example Usage:
--------------

1) Type "help <package name>"
   to view help for a Quartus Prime Tcl package.

   Example: help ::quartus::project

2) Type "help <command name>"
   to view long help for a Quartus Prime Tcl command.

   Example: help project_open

3) Type "help -quartus"
   to view help on the predefined global "quartus" Tcl array.

   Example: help -quartus

4) Type "help -examples"
   to view examples of Quartus Prime Tcl usage.

   Example: help -examples

